\ Phase 4 Slice 6e dogfood: `if` in a polymorphic body. `mymax`/`choose` each
\ branch once; `mymax3` nests an `if` inside an `if` arm, checking D4's claim
\ that nested `if` falls out of the recursive poly-walk rather than needing a
\ dedicated mechanism.

: mymax ( 'T: Copy Ord 'T -- 'T ) over over > if drop else swap drop end ;

: choose ( 'T 'T bool -- 'T ) | a b flag | flag if a b drop else b a drop end ;

: mymax3 ( 'T: Copy Ord 'T 'T -- 'T )
  | a b c |
  a b > if
    a c > if a else c end
  else
    b c > if b else c end
  end ;

: main ( -- )
  2 5 9 mymax3 .
  2.0 5.0 9.0 mymax3 . ;
